{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":3154,"name":"","username":"alxa73","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/f0a364/{size}.png","created_at":"2024-11-27T20:09:55.112Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHello\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI received some empty creative tonie. I didn’t know until I got them into my hand \u003cimg src=\"https://forum.revvox.de/images/emoji/twitter/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nI’m looking for a way to get them functional.\u003cbr\u003e\nIs that possible to reinsert SLIX-L tags inside the head?\u003cbr\u003e\nFor how It may concern, It still remains the magnet in the figurine.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe opening was very clean. Creative has no dommage.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you for your help.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2024-11-27T20:09:55.112Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":94,"reads":44,"readers_count":43,"score":478.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":1011,"topic_slug":"is-that-possible-to-get-back-functional-empty-creative","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":358,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/is-that-possible-to-get-back-functional-empty-creative/1011/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":3157,"name":"henryk","username":"henryk","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.revvox.de/henryk/{size}/243_2.png","created_at":"2024-11-27T22:35:33.654Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi, if you are able to solder very small parts, then you can create such rfid pills by yourself and use them in your zombie creative tonies.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2024-11-27T22:35:53.553Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":44,"readers_count":43,"score":8.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":1011,"topic_slug":"is-that-possible-to-get-back-functional-empty-creative","display_username":"henryk","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":false,"staff":true,"user_id":136,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/is-that-possible-to-get-back-functional-empty-creative/1011/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":3162,"name":null,"username":"DSR","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.revvox.de/dsr/{size}/325_2.png","created_at":"2024-11-28T08:55:02.405Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eYes, the self made rfid Pills can be made by the describtion from Robert:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"477\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forum.revvox.de/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/e95f7d/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"https://forum.revvox.de/t/selfmade-slix-l-tags/477\"\u003eSelfmade SLIX-L Tags\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-wrapper  bullet\" href=\"/c/general/toniebox/34\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category-parent-bg\" style=\"background-color: #808281;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category-bg\" style=\"background-color: #808281;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category clear-badge\"\u003eToniebox\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    Hey there, i want to share my work at building custom tags for the Toniebox. \nWhat i did: \nBuy 5,6µH inductors  + SLIX-L chips and put the parts together \u003cimg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://forum.revvox.de/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\"slight_smile\" alt=\"slight_smile\" class=\"emoji\"\u003e \nFor those who want to make their own tags, more like the original Tonies, here is my (short) description. \n\u003ca name=\"bom-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#bom-1\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eBOM:\n1x Bourns RLB0608-5R6KL \n1x NXP SL2S5002FTB,115 \n\u003ca name=\"toollist-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#toollist-2\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eToollist:\nSharp knife (cutter or scalpel) \nSuper glue \nSoldering iron \nSolder (i used 0,3mm) - parts are veeery small \u003cimg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://forum.revvox.de/images/emoji/twitter/wink.png?v=12\" title=\"wink\" alt=\"wink\" class=\"emoji\"\u003e \nNormal Solder tip (i used a round one with …\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI tried it and it works well. Roberto even sent me the parts, because i could not get them without a lot of shiping cost.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut you have to enjoy the process and the tinkering, otherways its not worth the efford.\u003c/p\u003e",